{"id":"ca_rcel","lemma":"cárcel","pos":"noun","rank":609,"glosses":["prison"],"ipa":"/ˈkaɾθel/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cárceles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-c%C3%A1rcel.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi marido está en la cárcel.","en":"My husband is in jail.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567971","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"husband"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Por qué no estás en la cárcel?","en":"Why aren't you in jail?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/162563","words":[null,null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]},{"text":"¿Qué haces fuera de la cárcel?","en":"What are you doing out of jail?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/532325","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"away from"]]},{"text":"Las cárceles están superpobladas.","en":"Prisons are overcrowded.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Podría ir a la cárcel.","en":"I could go to jail.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448618","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}